  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development phase combi-track &quot;Life Science &amp; Health&quot; in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall purpose of the combi-track is to guide collaborations between the Netherlands and Kenya in a combined effort to strengthen the Kenyan healthcare system and improve access to healthcare for the different groups that are excluded now, geographically or socio-economically.This project focuses on the development phase of the new combi-track for Life Sciences and Health in Kenya and aims to get a common understanding of this new approach for the project group (the Netherlands embassy in Nairobi, Kenya, the Netherlands Enterprise Agency (RVO), MoFA) and decide on the best way forward and design an overall intervention framework.</narrative>
  </description>
